                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This might be a good game with a nice story BUT I can't tell at all 'cause I am not able to master or get used to the battle system. It's just a nightmare for me and it's not enjoyable in the slightest if I get frustrated with the fight mechanics. I also know that this is solely on me but the battle system is not intuitive for me playing it on my laptop without a mouse.\n\nPositive about this game is that you can create your own character, fish, farm, craft items, finish quests and unlock music while visiting different areas.\n\nMaybe others will like it and I would rather give it a neutral review if that was possible.",
